NOTE: Zw round-trips to ~1% rather than exactly, because aircraft.py's CLa relation subtracts the trim CD and the plant's dZ/dw at alpha=0 also picks up the induced-drag slope. This is a linearisation-point effect, not a unit error: the discrepancy is O(CD), not O(57.3) or O(b/c).
